      "id": "claim_8fe6cafe00c146cebf5c0e411d1ae5ed",
      "statement": "The project analyzes three independent extractions of the same production agent system, each in a dated folder: base 1 (2026-09-trace-law-flow, full trace of 1,000 executions, Oct/2025–Aug/2026, the foundational analysis where the taxonomy was born), base 2 (2026-09-trace-law-flow-second, an independent 1,000-execution full-trace sample that runs on the compliance machine — the repo folder holds documentation only), and base 3 (2026-10-trace-law-flow-third, an Athena parquet with one row per error step plus a context window — 31,421 rows: 30,141 structured errors and 1,280 suspects — the project's current source of truth).",
